{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "02c4bd83a0e14093f1b128da787b83e0b1e839d8c35da662460a8153625f9cef", "ja": "もしかしたら？　ガラムマサラ！", "zh": "难不成是？葛拉姆马萨拉！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "099f1e75532148a45c17bd32e6609e928057a0bdd038b083e98c7a04d34b6c90", "ja": "元気のない可奈を誘い出した莉緒。プロデュ\nーサーも一緒に、オトナなお店でランチを食\nべる。杏奈のカレーに戸惑い、感想を言えな\nかった可奈だが、莉緒に背中を押され、杏奈\nのためにも意見を伝えようと決意する。", "zh": "莉緒邀请没精神的可奈出门。\n和制作人一起，在成熟风格的店里吃午餐。\n面对杏奈的咖喱不知所措，没能说出感想的可奈，\n在莉緒的鼓励下，也为了杏奈，决定把自己的意见告诉她。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_05_1000_p", "source_sha256": "ba56f429756e2aa75e904035999bd49fb718e9ef58d57dda5cf89b8b83c51ee8", "ja": "（なんだか元気のない可奈を、誘い出した莉緒。\nどこに行く気なのかな？）", "zh": "（莉绪把看起来没什么精神的可奈叫了出来。她打算去哪儿呢？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_05_1001_036kan", "source_sha256": "44bf3fc692f0226323a82a7db30334aa32bc36d02c0b575064d5d6b203424449", "ja": "わあ～。すごくオシャレなお店ですね！\nあ、あの、莉緒さん……ここは？", "zh": "哇～，好时髦的店啊！啊，那个，莉绪姐……这里是？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_05_1002_046rio", "source_sha256": "b00cf74f5084a2ffb6567ac17646fbf6e7442256298ac6047eeb27729584cef5", "ja": "ここはね、このみ姉さんや歌織ちゃん達と一緒に、\n飲みに来るお店のひとつなの♪", "zh": "这里是我和好姐妹木实、歌织她们一起过来喝酒的店之一哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_05_1003_036kan", "source_sha256": "19c25d1212cf33a2e69dc2c12037a63faf173333002acff850914db638f01064", "ja": "ええっ！？　オ、オトナのお店じゃないですか！\n私なんて、まだ中学生だし……ダ、ダメですよ～！", "zh": "诶诶！？这、这不是大人来的店吗！\n我还只是初中生……不、不行啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_05_1004_046rio", "source_sha256": "58c9b00f1f0305c5a9bfa7e05c0d10c2841a997c25d507420ccbfba6384a4644", "ja": "大丈夫♪　このお店、昼間はランチもやってるの。\nすごく美味しいから、可奈ちゃんも気に入ると思うわ！", "zh": "没事的♪这家店白天也提供午餐哦。\n味道特别棒，可奈肯定也会喜欢的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_05_1005_p", "source_sha256": "7792eea14f1817a1062cf9596603ed3de83baf87f28e3b3d35ff20e0b3b267bd", "ja": "うん、心配いらないと思うよ。\nあっちには、子ども連れのお客さんもいるみたいだし。", "zh": "嗯，我觉得不用担心。\n那边好像也有带孩子一起来的客人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_05_1006_036kan", "source_sha256": "542e3833395bc1aaa1e8aee96770d4acd4f012819118ebcf63d8f426be637788", "ja": "あ、ほんとですね！　そっか……ランチタイムは、\n中学生でも入っていいんだ！　やった～♪", "zh": "啊，真的呢！原来如此……午餐时间，\n就算是初中生也可以进去！太好了～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_05_1007_036kan", "source_sha256": "888e7b37c6960f02850169ed868ada87b61f8587b173ba4145d400cce4811641", "ja": "メニュー、メニュー……♪　うわーっ！\nすっごくたくさん、種類があるんですね。", "zh": "菜单、菜单……♪　哇——！\n种类真的好多啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_05_1008_046rio", "source_sha256": "66daf010a2745a05aac4b46764bf254191ab4be4df96a79a95fb3ba84cdd918c", "ja": "そうね。このお店はおつまみの種類が多いから、\nそれだけランチも豊富なのよね。", "zh": "是啊。这家店的小菜种类很多，所以午餐的选择也很丰富呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_05_1009_036kan", "source_sha256": "148448e4fa143b74e7287de9b244f47ff06425f772cbd2ff8ad238173e5e22a6", "ja": "うーん、たくさんあるのはうれしいですけど……。\n全部おいしそうで、迷っちゃいますよ～！", "zh": "嗯——种类这么多当然很好，可是……每样看起来都好好吃，让我都不知道该选什么了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_05_1010_p", "source_sha256": "cabfd7cb54293464edbd7eb41778a7819937505d501c4ffc19b735225634a9dd", "ja": "そうだな、これだけあると……。\n莉緒は、何にするか決まったのか？", "zh": "是啊，这么多的话……莉绪，你决定好要吃什么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_05_1011_046rio", "source_sha256": "38a36a283bdcb364a5f84f02e293099e7fff0de2d3dbcd4cfbd1ffb16895b282", "ja": "そうねぇ、私は……オススメセットにしようかな。\nせっかくオススメしてくれてるんだしね♪", "zh": "是啊……我嘛……就选推荐套餐吧。难得人家都推荐了，就选这个吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_05_1012_036kan", "source_sha256": "dc9bcc06492770cd138dbcf0c1f95b694b97e8b6de1a56c141201984e27a87c7", "ja": "わあ……莉緒さん、なんかオトナって感じですね！\nそれじゃ私も、莉緒さんと同じのにします！", "zh": "哇……莉绪小姐，感觉好成熟啊！\n那我也要和莉绪小姐一样的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_05_1013_p", "source_sha256": "59eb32bc94c8ee0feacb5b0d73e5786610ca96b3fdc9c3e9c8ae49ea725c3563", "ja": "そうだな。俺も同じメニューにしようかな。\nすみませーん！", "zh": "也是。我也点和你一样的菜单吧。服务员——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_05_1014_036kan", "source_sha256": "9d8d15668edfc694b0109bfbf4d2762617dcb8ef6d50cf7d21817c7f4f6168bc", "ja": "あ……このお料理も、カレーの味がするんですね！\nはじめて食べたけど……おいしい～♪", "zh": "啊……这道菜也有咖喱的味道呢！\n虽然是第一次吃……但好好吃～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_05_1015_046rio", "source_sha256": "8a8c837b7dbae9e3ffb24d629946e3881d7c2678e099a528effb53f91fa07f01", "ja": "今日は、長芋とベーコンのカレー炒めね。\n……ウフフ♪　やっと笑ってくれたわね、可奈ちゃん。", "zh": "今天是山药培根咖喱炒菜。\n……呵呵♪你终于笑了呢，可奈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_05_1016_036kan", "source_sha256": "61af57e29966d627ce232790d785a821d8b4c4dd62fb6915cae215246b2a2d15", "ja": "えっ？　あっ……。\n……私、そんなに暗い顔してました？", "zh": "诶？啊……  \n……我的表情有那么阴沉吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_05_1017_046rio", "source_sha256": "58e80bfc941225df79ec1bc9e50e3d21c1c3cf33ff75e88286fe1f933a829969", "ja": "っていうより、元気がないって感じかしら。\nひょっとして、杏奈ちゃんの作ったカレーが原因？", "zh": "倒不如说，是看起来没什么精神呢。\n难道说，原因出在杏奈做的咖喱上？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_05_1018_036kan", "source_sha256": "dc8afc1f0609dc31d4ec7af0a2b7d93075ff6209de33cd2a220ceb3b3d7bc4ab", "ja": "ええっ！？　ど、どうして分かるんですか？", "zh": "诶！？你、你是怎么知道的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_05_1019_p", "source_sha256": "110c2016f96590989e947e8e8c79e4dccdf9c08a42e719b2d97ac58011ff3ba2", "ja": "まあ、可奈はわかりやすいところがあるし。\nそれで、何が気になってるんだ？", "zh": "嘛，可奈有些地方还是很好看出来的。\n所以，你在意的是什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_05_1020_036kan", "source_sha256": "f7899520802bf56d36375ba5ecae48ba9949b743824de46d089174323ed1002b", "ja": "えっと……杏奈ちゃんのカレー、美味しかったです。\nでも、私が思ってたのとは違うカレーだったから……。", "zh": "那个……杏奈的咖喱很好吃。\n但是，和我原本想的不一样…… bic?", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_05_1021_p", "source_sha256": "7645938b027faebabc163120d433c7dfa7151437bc61d5af75d59ef4a3e291d1", "ja": "まあ……。\nコップに入ったカレーは、ふつう驚くよな……。", "zh": "也是……装在杯子里的咖喱，换谁都会吓一跳吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_05_1022_036kan", "source_sha256": "7d48d28333bab46a8152eaeea47a6fb702fad15e246e4d7b977b3144ca81cfd6", "ja": "でもでも、杏奈ちゃんは「手軽に食べられる」って、\nうれしそうに言ってたし。", "zh": "可是可是，杏奈还一脸开心地说“吃起来很方便”来着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_05_1023_036kan", "source_sha256": "adf9b96f1eabfd4a3cf6ac86812cb6ad805113d01e2353aee116c5c22d03f61a", "ja": "私、おうちのカレーみたいなのを想像してて。\nだから、ちょっとさみしいなって思っちゃって……。", "zh": "我本来想象的是像家里做的那种咖喱。\n所以，就觉得有点失落……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_05_1024_p", "source_sha256": "8397f9e77cd1ea41c735ee8a510f2ad91e249f77c28d3e16d0f20148403bd9a4", "ja": "さみしい、か……。", "zh": "“寂寞”吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_05_1025_046rio", "source_sha256": "970cfc492619c2d23af2ef7f2b942d5d2613dcd0ebb9153cc8b38ad6681105a1", "ja": "初めて遭遇したカレーに、ビックリしちゃったのね。\nでも戸惑う気持ちもわからなくもないかな。", "zh": "第一次遇到咖喱，被吓了一跳呢。\n不过，困惑的心情我也不是完全不能理解。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_05_1026_046rio", "source_sha256": "1615700cac299d5daae654cb6282d0665574bb7c5130dbacab53b4a04fdb8db0", "ja": "私も、最初見たときはやっぱり戸惑ったし……。\nだけど、杏奈ちゃんが一生懸命なのはわかったから。", "zh": "我第一次看到时果然也有点不知所措……不过，我看得出来杏奈很努力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_05_1027_036kan", "source_sha256": "903d68025f64c040b2ea10bba6e89f807c7f94b432e5c4320ed4a7e439588a87", "ja": "それはわかるんですけど……。\nうう、莉緒さんはやっぱり大人だな～。", "zh": "这个我也明白……只是……\n呜呜，莉绪姐果然很成熟啊～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_05_1028_046rio", "source_sha256": "80ef3a99863e3f99f77ae7a65acc5f19e6f7c9f6cef2c6b6cb979b910a7b99a4", "ja": "まあ、そうなのかも。\n私の場合、お酒に合うカレーの方が身近だったから。", "zh": "嗯，或许是吧。\n对我来说，还是更常接触适合配酒的咖喱。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_05_1029_046rio", "source_sha256": "6fd83203b49be746597adbdcf0cd6cc8798fdd45d0edded3bc0d437bb2bca7b3", "ja": "カレー味のおつまみって、結構色々あるのよね。\nそういうのも、大人の経験なのかもね？　ウフフ♪", "zh": "咖喱味的下酒菜还真是有不少呢。\n这也算是成年人的经验吧？呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_05_1030_p", "source_sha256": "922aa6d8df5bc5d4295d3122d2434c2dc132ef75fe2d6c683d10a4f90cb204a2", "ja": "なるほど。莉緒のカレーは、お酒のおつまみ。可奈の\nカレーは、家族の食卓。杏奈のカレーは、手軽さ……。", "zh": "原来如此。莉绪的咖喱，是下酒菜。可奈的\n咖喱，是家人的餐桌。杏奈的咖喱，是方便……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_05_1031_p", "source_sha256": "8813e74985002fcccbd51eda07ff80d0bff8fdf8e87521d873401744a27a9c9b", "ja": "もしかしたら、カレーっていうのは、\n色んな人のそばに寄り添ってくれる食べ物なのかもな。", "zh": "说不定，咖喱其实是一种\n能贴近各种各样的人的食物吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_05_1032_036kan", "source_sha256": "98dd79529a30f0d0dc6c29edcc9b75278bae546b808973d916cd8ca30ac3e674", "ja": "色んな人のそばに……あ、そうですね。\nカレーって、たくさんの種類や形があるんですね！", "zh": "陪伴在各种各样的人身边……啊，说得也是。\n原来咖喱也有这么多种类和形态啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_05_1033_036kan", "source_sha256": "b5f4e0bd548c55bce36e9d79bea6ab71bcc467da4e52fe2e43db3cd9734c7ac6", "ja": "私、よく知らないのに、杏奈ちゃんのカレーを、\nさみしいなんて思っちゃって……うう、イヤな子～！", "zh": "我明明对咖喱了解得不多，却觉得杏奈的咖喱好寂寞……呜呜，我真是个坏孩子——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_05_1034_p", "source_sha256": "e12cf47a41f760568ac77edad7ea82c1a79124e34f64898d81cff3994d4260e6", "ja": "いや、杏奈はそういう感想が聞きたいんじゃないか？\nだから、試食会もしたんだろうし。", "zh": "不，杏奈想听的正是这种感想吧？\n所以她才会办试吃会啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_05_1035_p", "source_sha256": "484d556f1e335f9f9cf24ae53b1e63e7bbebf49d78c37521d2dd1e91c82b5a50", "ja": "「このカレー、上手に出来たかな？」って。\n一生懸命作ったからこそ、意見が欲しいと思うよ。", "zh": "“这咖喱，做得好不好呢？”像这样。\n正因为是用心做出来的，所以才更想要大家的意见吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_05_1036_036kan", "source_sha256": "6c731cdc560642a18942e5788c1ad757b081d289c1a8e1101bb5cb5ab4a04a87", "ja": "あ……！", "zh": "啊……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_05_1037_046rio", "source_sha256": "c3e9b0753e5ec686f5f6ab5539db4ff505a754265fc18ffabb1bfffc9ad7f15e", "ja": "そうよね！　私も言っちゃおっと。もう少し飲みやすく\nした方がいいかもって。可奈ちゃんも、ね？", "zh": "就是嘛！我也要说出来。或许可以调得更容易入口一点。可奈也是吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_05_1038_036kan", "source_sha256": "65cc4520714edf5e211e35e9e26d5e5bbb7709319cccbfb51cd7c6818be8c628", "ja": "は……はい、私もちゃんと伝えたいです！\nビックリしたけど……すっごく美味しかったよって！", "zh": "是……是的，我也想好好传达给她！\n虽然吓了一跳……但真的特别好吃！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_05_1039_p", "source_sha256": "fe535d0049b19a8d0e0084d86d296cdd005aef3a194a98471723426254260ba3", "ja": "（莉緒のおかげで、可奈の戸惑いも消えたみたいだ。\nゲーミングカレー……さらなる進化を遂げそうだな！）", "zh": "（多亏了莉绪，可奈的困惑似乎也消失了。游戏咖喱……看来要迎来更进一步的进化了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
